#   269  Opening of the Dark Portal       289  Scholomance
#   329  Stratholme                       349  Maraudon
#   389  Ragefire Chasm                   429  Dire Maul
#   540  The Shattered Halls              542  The Blood Furnace
#   543  Hellfire Ramparts                545  The Steamvault
#   546  The Underbog                     547  The Slave Pens
#   552  The Arcatraz                     553  The Botanica
#   554  The Mechanar                     555  Shadow Labyrinth
#   556  Sethekk Halls                    557  Mana-Tombs
#   558  Auchenai Crypts                  560  Escape From Durnholde
#   574  Utgarde Keep                     575  Utgarde Pinnacle
#   576  The Nexus                        578  The Oculus
